  message: "Done in PR #2237 (dev f4342ccc1). The test is packages/hypergumbo-core/tests/test_producer_coherence.py::test_live_tree_producer_axis_ratchet (median 67.7 s in the timing store). It looped over four axes, each a pass over every source file of the repository; it separated cleanly into one parametrized test per axis with the same assertions. Measured 2026-11-17 on this machine: under coverage, one process, 13.14 / 13.69 / 15.52 / 18.66 s (4 passed in 67.26 s); without coverage across four workers, 4 passed in 9.51 s. Control: a stale value planted in the Symbol.kind baseline failed [symbol_kind] alone (1 failed, 3 passed). Nothing it checked is lost: same finders, same baseline, same two assertions per axis; the function name is unchanged. NOT MEASURED: how many of the 16 replayed PRs now fit 60 test-seconds; the replay was not re-run. The slowest single test in the suite is now some other test; I did not look up which."  # 4113
